# FIBO slice for the Semantica fibo-lei example.
#
# A small extract of FIBO release master_2026Q2
# (https://github.com/edmcouncil/fibo/tree/master_2026Q2, commit f59157fe), plus the
# OMG Commons Ontology Library terms those FIBO axioms refer to. Only the classes,
# properties, and axioms the example's SHACL shapes are derived from are kept; this is
# not a maintained FIBO mapping. Every source ontology is listed below as dct:source
# (its owl:versionIRI).
#
# Copyright notices carried by the source ontologies:
